WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:09.655
"It's hot in here!" Ringo wiped his head.

2
00:00:09.656 --> 00:00:13.643
He and Lucy were in the kitchen.

3
00:00:13.644 --> 00:00:17.645
They were helping the cook, Rosco.

4
00:00:17.646 --> 00:00:20.469
"Chop, chop, chop!" Rosco said.

5
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:34.246
"It's almost lunchtime!"

6
00:00:34.247 --> 00:00:38.805
Ringo grabbed a box of flame peppers.

7
00:00:38.806 --> 00:00:43.907
"There are only four peppers," he said.

8
00:00:43.908 --> 00:00:49.292
Rosco sighed. "I ordered four boxes.

9
00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.105
I guess that's all I got."

10
00:00:52.106 --> 00:00:56.241
"I can't find any moon roots," Lucy said.

11
00:00:56.242 --> 00:00:58.752
Rosco shook his head.

12
00:00:58.753 --> 00:01:01.323
"I tried to buy some.

13
00:01:01.324 --> 00:01:07.559
The farmer didn't have any."

14
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.838
Ringo chopped a flame pepper.

15
00:01:10.839 --> 00:01:13.146
He worked fast.

16
00:01:13.147 --> 00:01:16.027
"That's odd," Ringo thought.

17
00:01:16.028 --> 00:01:19.181
"Why didn't the farmer have moon roots?"

18
00:01:19.182 --> 00:01:22.740
One pepper rolled away from Ringo.

19
00:01:22.741 --> 00:01:25.741
"That pepper's going to fall!" Rosco said.

20
00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:27.761
"We can't waste any vegetables!"

21
00:01:27.762 --> 00:01:35.122
"Sorry!" Ringo grabbed the pepper.

22
00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:39.726
Then he chopped some more.

23
00:01:39.727 --> 00:01:43.198
Ringo's eyes started to burn.

24
00:01:43.199 --> 00:01:47.478
Tears rolled down his cheeks.

25
00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:51.010
"Why are you crying?" Lucy asked.

26
00:01:51.011 --> 00:01:53.523
Ringo quickly wiped his eyes.

27
00:01:53.524 --> 00:01:56.343
"I'm not crying," he said.

28
00:01:56.344 --> 00:01:58.293
Lucy grinned.

29
00:01:58.294 --> 00:02:04.749
She flicked a piece of pepper at Ringo.

30
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.545
"Hey!" Rosco said.

31
00:02:07.546 --> 00:02:11.048
"You're wasting vegetables!

32
00:02:11.049 --> 00:02:15.828
Both of you, report to Captain Nova now!"

